  "summary": {
    "plain": "XMASS analysed all of its data, 1590.9 live days over five years, for several kinds of dark matter and found none.",
    "technical": "Full data set (20 Nov 2013 - 1 Feb 2019, analysis threshold 1.0 keVee, 0.5 keVee in the later half). Annual-modulation search in the whole 832 kg: 2.3e-42 cm^2 at 8 GeV/c^2; at 0.5 GeV/c^2 the Migdal effect and bremsstrahlung give 1.4e-35 cm^2 and 1.1e-33 cm^2."
